From: Filipe Manana <fdmanana@suse.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 16:56:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] btrfs: defrag: fix deadlock between defrag and delalloc space
 reservation
References: bsc#1258210
Patch-mainline: 6.18.52
Git-commit: ba02eab28041f9a4bbe9fc90c7249644fef6de0f

[ Upstream commit ba02eab28041f9a4bbe9fc90c7249644fef6de0f ]

